---

Attribution: the ChatGPT consumer-account protocol implementation in this
plugin is re-derived from `basketikun/chatgpt2api`
(https://github.com/basketikun/chatgpt2api), MIT-licensed. The upstream wire
formats (payloads, session headers, fingerprint fields) are kept
byte-compatible with the reference on purpose, and the golden-file tests in
`internal/upstream/testdata/` pin that compatibility. No code is copied from
the reference; all implementation, tests and documentation in this repo are
original.
